#: ../../reference.rst:240
msgid ""
"``challenge_at`` and ``deny_at`` lie in -1000 to 1000 with ``deny_at`` at "
"or above ``challenge_at``, and ``bits_step`` in 1 to 1000. A "
"``challenge`` block belongs only to ``CHALLENGE`` rules, with 1 to 64 "
"work bits. ``limits`` gives a rule its own quota: ``rate`` 1 to 1,000,000 "
"and ``window_seconds`` 1 to 86,400 are required, ``ban_seconds`` (at most "
"86,400) is optional, and ``WEIGH`` rules cannot carry limits. The "
"reputation trie of ``ip_rules`` holds at most 8,192 nodes. Each rule may "
"use one spelling of each criterion."
msgstr ""
"``challenge_at`` 和 ``deny_at`` 的取值范围为 -1000 到 1000，并且 "
"``deny_at`` 不小于 ``challenge_at``；``bits_step`` 的取值范围为 1 到 1000。"
"``challenge`` 块只属于 ``CHALLENGE`` 规则，工作比特为 1 到 64。``limits`` 为"
"规则设定自己的配额：``rate``\\ （1 到 1,000,000）和 ``window_seconds``\\ （"
"1 到 86,400）是必需的，``ban_seconds``\\ （最多 86,400）是可选的，``WEIGH`` "
"规则不能带有 limits。``ip_rules`` 的信誉字典树最多容纳 8,192 个节点。每条规"
"则对每个条件只能使用一种写法。"

#: ../../reference.rst:242
msgid ""
"Pattern grammar: ``.*`` or ``*`` match anything; ``^...$`` anchors an "
"exact path; a trailing ``*``, ``/*``, or ``.*`` is a prefix; a pattern "
"starting with ``/`` is an exact path; anything else is a case-insensitive "
"substring. Path patterns match the path in normal form (one slash between "
"segments, no dot segments, unreserved characters unescaped, other escapes "
"with upper-case hexadecimal digits), so a pattern holding ``;``, ``%2F``, "
"``%5C`` or ``\\`` matches nothing, and path matching is case-sensitive "
"(SID 0003)."
msgstr ""
"模式语法：``.*`` 或 ``*`` 匹配任何内容；``^...$`` 锚定一个精确路径；末尾的 "
"``*``、``/*`` 或 ``.*`` 表示前缀；以 ``/`` 开头的模式是精确路径；其他情况是"
"不区分大小写的子串。路径模式匹配规范形式的路径（段之间只有一个斜杠，没有点段，"
"非保留字符不转义，其他转义使用大写十六进制数字），因此包含 ``;``、``%2F``、"
"``%5C`` 或 ``\\`` 的模式不会匹配任何内容，并且路径匹配区分大小写（SID 0003）。"

#: ../../reference.rst:244
msgid "Storage Tables"
msgstr "存储表"

#: ../../reference.rst:247
msgid ""
"``policy_revision``, ``policies``, ``policy_inspection``, "
"``ip_reputation``, ``incident_receipts``, ``security_incidents`` (with "
"the 256-byte embedding), the full-text index (``incidents_fts``, FTS5 "
"over canonical tokens, on SQLite; the ``tsvector`` column ``search`` with "
"a GIN index on PostgreSQL) and ``sibuna_schema``; the console adds 33 "
"``console_*`` tables. Stored action, algorithm and mode names are "
"lowercase. Incident ids are ``node_id << 40 | sequence``, unique across a "
"cluster without coordination; node ids run from 1 to 8,388,607."
msgstr ""
"``policy_revision``、``policies``、``policy_inspection``、"
"``ip_reputation``、``incident_receipts``、``security_incidents``\\ （含 256 "
"字节的嵌入向量）、全文索引（SQLite 上为 ``incidents_fts``，即基于规范词元的 "
"FTS5；PostgreSQL 上为带 GIN 索引的 ``tsvector`` 列 ``search``）以及 "
"``sibuna_schema``；控制台另外增加 33 张 ``console_*`` 表。存储的动作、算法和"
"模式名称均为小写。事件 ID 为 ``node_id << 40 | sequence``，无需协调即可在集"
"群内保持唯一；节点 ID 的范围为 1 到 8,388,607。"

